BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      In the beginning, two rivers flowed through separate valleys-the River of Giving and the R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        iver of Return. Each was shallow and weak, barely sustaining the villages along their ba) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (        nks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      One day, a wise elder had a vision. She climbed the mountain between the valleys and broke) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (         through the stone barrier. The River of Giving rushed down into the valley of Return, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        nd as the waters met, they swirled together and magically tripled in volume.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      The villagers of Return rejoiced, but the elder warned: "This blessing comes with responsi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        bility. You must send water back upstream to the River of Giving, or both rivers will ev) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        entually run dry.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      The people of Return debated. Some wanted to keep all the water. But the wisest among them) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (         remembered the elder's words. They built channels and wheels to return half the swollen) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (         river back upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      As the water flowed back, something miraculous happened-it sustained the River of Giving, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        which continued to flow down, multiplying again and again. Both valleys prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      The elders teach: **Generosity flows downward and multiplies, but reciprocity must flow ba) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        ck upward, or all abundance ceases.** Trust creates the current; return maintains the cy) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        cle.) Tj ET
