BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      Long ago, a Wanderer and a Guardian lived in a sacred grove with twin springs. Each mornin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        g, one received five silver coins from the earth. By ancient magic, any coins placed in ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        the springs would emerge threefold in the other's pool.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The first day, the Wanderer received the coins and, trembling with hope, placed nearly fou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        r into the spring. The waters churned, and twelve coins appeared in the Guardian's pool.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (         The Guardian, understanding the gift's magnitude, took six coins and returned them thro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        ugh the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      Both stood richer than before-the Wanderer held seven coins, the Guardian held six. They h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        ad discovered the secret: generous trust, met with proportional reciprocity, births abun) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        dance for all.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      The pattern continued, roles reversing with each dawn. They learned that neither grasping ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        nor hoarding brought prosperity. The one who gave much was rewarded when the other retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ned fairly. The one who received abundance maintained the cycle by honoring the gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The grove's spirit whispered: "Trust multiplies only when reciprocated. Give boldly when y) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ou hold the coins; return justly when you hold the bounty. Neither exploiting trust nor ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        betraying generosity-this is the path where both ascend together.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      And so the springs flowed eternal.) Tj ET
