BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      The Guardian faced a terrible test. "I could return seven and keep eight," they thought, ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (        but would that honor such total surrender?" They returned eight coins, keeping seven.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      But something felt wrong. The Wanderer held eight coins-a fortune!-yet trembled with uneas) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (        e. "I gave from desperation, not wisdom," they realized. "I tested rather than trusted.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      The grove's spirit appeared: "You have learned the deeper truth. Generosity means giving m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        uch while keeping enough to stand with dignity. Give four of five-this shows trust witho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        ut recklessness. Return half of what multiplies-this honors the gift without self-destru) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        ction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      "Complete surrender is not trust; it is fear testing faith. True partnership requires both) Tj ET
