BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        sts the desperate gamble.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      The Wanderer understood. Consistency, not extremity, keeps the springs flowing eternal.) Tj ET
